    "preamble": "Mallemula Narayana vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 9 September, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No. 3750 of 2020 O R D E R:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. seeking to quash the proceedings in FIR No.12 of 2020 on the file of the Station House Officer, Badvel (U) Police Station, Kadapa District, against the petitioners for the offence punishable under Sections 188, 283 IPC and Sections 57 and 58 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. Learned counsel for the petitioners has placed reliance on the order dated 21.07.2020 passed in Criminal Petition No.2600 of 2020 by this Court.",
